, 但客人不至於需要給一星這麼惡毒.\n人家辛辛苦苦經營一家小餐廳, 一碗拉麵只賣一百多, 有菜有肉有蛋有愛, 你不想等就別吃了, 貪便宜硬要吃, 又不甘願等後清理桌面, 然後就一星報復, 做人做到這樣, 你至於嗎??\n不過\n店家真正值得注意的是, 老闆對熱通道沒概念, 廚房跟用餐區都很熱, 冷氣開了等於沒開, 建議老闆花點時間找專業調整一下空調與空氣流動設計, 不管廚師或客人都會開心很多.",null,[0,145]]]],[],[null,null,3393,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KTU9VRk1aMjFwWkZkRmExbG1PR1ZPWWpCZldVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x7cae8f306130cc37!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmJMOUFMZ21pZFdFa1lmOGVOYjBfWUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KTU9VRk1aMjFwWkZkRmExbG1PR1ZPWWpCZldVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KTU9VRk1aMjFwWkZkRmExbG1PR1ZPWWpCZldVRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KTU9VRk1aMjFwWkZkRmExbG1PR1ZPWWpCZldVRRILMGVHcXN4bzZ1azEaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tSk1PVUZNWjIxcFpGZEZhMWxtT0dWT1lqQmZXVUUSCzBlR3FzeG82dWsxIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARN8wwYTCPrnwqCzBlR3FzeG82dWsx\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjw--a18tSWAxV8sVYBHXgcPcMQoykIXigK"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwis0uy18tSWAxX7gNYIHZYOI84Q0pMFCBwoAQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjw--a18tSWAxV8sVYBHXgcPcMQ0pMFCEooAQ"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pjeE9ESm9ZM2t5VVhBMVpHcHZkVmsxT1RkU1VIYxAB",["0x0:0x7cae8f306130cc37",null,1779620067026845,1779620067026845,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112095602148692018349/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Jen-Hsuan Liu","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWrz7Gq17tCbsnttwnb6FcZMz1olVlrQMqawEwgsgjogvhTFSLEvw\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112095602148692018349?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"112095602148692018349",null,98,704,null,[1,7,1],16,["在地嚮導 · 98 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwjw--a18tSWAxV8sVYBHXgcPcMQpr8GCGAoAA"]]]],null,"3 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[5],null,[["CIABIhDgbSIT3fi-oChUtVySvc8X",["CIABIhDgbSIT3fi-oChUtVySvc8X",10,12,null,null,null,["